<title>USA: ALANCO says system wins approval in China.</title>
<headline>ALANCO says system wins approval in China.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALANCO Environmental Resources Corp said Friday its Dry Sorbent Injection Systems had been approved by the Dezhou Thermal Power Plant in China, helping to establish ALANCO as a provider for air pollution control equipment in China.</p>
<p>Chinese officials estimate that a one percent share of the pollution control market could generate $700 million in revenue, according to ALANCO.</p>
<p>ALANCO said its system is one of five environmental technologies listed in China's environmental cleanup plan for the next century.</p>
</text>
